# Wave W17-R (Route 126 Trench): door floor — volcanic-grey trench sand: a dark warm-grey swim sand under the crater, carrying the runway lights in the floor’s own art — sparse amber glints standing in two loose runs across the tread, the LUMIFIN rows that lead to the Crater Door drawn as light, not creatures (design: swim paths lit by rows of glowing LUMIFIN like runway lights leading to the door; art layer only). Route 126 Trench’s own floor — the darkest trench floor in Maris: volcanic grey and carried-light amber where Route 124 Trench’s shaft floor is bright daylight sand.
